{"time": 1768487313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480601321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（她，看起来是住在哪的，是不是快到她的房间了）"}
{"time": 1768487325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985784237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1310711346]”你说。“"}
{"time": 1768487334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497669668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“其实我也在找这个人”"}
{"time": 1768487365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61890028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”那很巧了。“"}
{"time": 1768487381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115188496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”但是，你为什么要找一个不知道名字的人呢？“"}
{"time": 1768487390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977307352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“大概几天前，我……路过这边，当时天很黑，还下着小雨，我走得很快，想赶紧回去。就是突然间有一种奇怪的感觉，就是那种突然被针管扎了一下的感觉，我当时感到很不安。就在这个时候，我看见一个穿着红衣服的人，站在 4 楼的窗户那里。那个人直勾勾地盯着我，可是当时天很黑，我连他是正对着我还是背对着我都看不清。我当时有些害怕，就赶紧离开了。”"}
{"time": 1768487408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150390357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”我感觉很奇怪，所以想上来看看“"}
{"time": 1768487467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271960201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“所以，你要委托我们找他，仅仅是因为有一种奇怪的感觉？”"}
{"time": 1768487474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256290261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”各位哥哥姐姐，你们如果发现什么，可以和我分享一下线索吗？“"}
{"time": 1768487475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786399616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“红色衣服？可以说的再详细一些吗”\n“还有。。。路过这边？你不是住这里的人吗”"}
{"time": 1768487512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931904842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”你们是侦探吗？我倒是很想委托，但可能付不起那么多钱。。。“"}
{"time": 1768487535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348847416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”也不是很想找他，只是感觉有些奇怪，所以上来看看“"}
{"time": 1768487548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551582041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1244514674]（[CQ:at,qq=1258719565] 它说是邻居）"}
{"time": 1768487557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127021790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”我是住在这附近的。不过不在这栋楼“"}
{"time": 1768487592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050264261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1348847416]“这样吧，既然这么好奇，不如陪我们一起找找？”"}
{"time": 1768487608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91185386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“你同意我们就可以分享线索”"}
{"time": 1768487630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883327402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”不行不行“她摆了摆头”我只是一个学生，平时要上课的。。。“"}
{"time": 1768487661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628275637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“我们大学生倒是已经期末考完了呢~”"}
{"time": 1768487667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081705296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”要，要是不可以的话就算了，不打扰大家了。。。“"}
{"time": 1768487713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894431698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“这样吧，你留给我们联系方式，我们视情况可以与你分享线索。”"}
{"time": 1768487714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“嘛，先不说这个，毕竟我们不能随便泄露委托人的信息，但是如果你有可以分享给我们的线索，我们乐意和你交换以获得更多”"}
{"time": 1768487793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882575233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”对不起，我也不知道什么。。。所以今天才上来看看。这是我的电话号，如果可以的话还请务必告诉我什么线索，我也会在力所能及的范围内帮忙的“"}
