{"time": 1768488703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498784797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=460148829]“前不久，在奥莱斯大桥下发生了一起恶性杀人事件，现场惨烈，死者惨遭\n分尸，身份尚不明确。据悉，死者年龄大概在 30 岁左右，身上并没有可以证明\n身份的信息。这起案件与前不久发生的另一起入室抢劫案之间的关系尚不明确。\n在此警方呼吁大家不要在夜里出门，如遇可疑人物或是有相关线索，请尽快向\n警察局汇报，圣诞将至，还望大家提高警惕……”"}
{"time": 1768488725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887643477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（可能是死了）"}
{"time": 1768488735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721908480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”你们要上楼的钥匙？给你“他从抽屉里拿出一个钥匙"}
{"time": 1768488757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954030784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（“唉，他还欠着我两个月房租呢，”）"}
{"time": 1768488762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917766016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”不过楼顶一般也没人去，你们去干什么“"}
{"time": 1768488777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231675356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“我们认为有重要的线索”"}
{"time": 1768488786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393958990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“可能——”"}
{"time": 1768488808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949801370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "分尸杀人案件。。。还有入室抢劫案吗"}
{"time": 1768488949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132302115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "路上去保亭和新闻网站看看吧。。"}
{"time": 1768488958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420827136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "总之 他递给你们了顶楼的钥匙"}
{"time": 1768488970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063226267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（保亭是？"}
{"time": 1768488987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674170102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“毕竟我们勘察到，有什么人经由窗户进出布莱克先生的房间呢”"}
{"time": 1768488997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808664995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“所以也许屋顶也会有痕迹”"}
{"time": 1768489001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763209223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（报亭）"}
{"time": 1768489007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312869265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1917766016]“上面调查到一些相关的线索”"}
{"time": 1768489012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142944021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“具体就不能透露了”"}
{"time": 1768489027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099383041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=674170102]（没必要说这么多，防人之心不可无）"}
{"time": 1768489045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286380687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”行  你们注意安全。记得用完把钥匙还我“"}
{"time": 1768489048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061047436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（让别人露马脚也好）"}
{"time": 1768489053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123968181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（我们已经暴露身份了）"}
{"time": 1768489072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277261222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（不如激一激）"}
{"time": 1768489094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258261564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#上楼"}
{"time": 1768489127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896395395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“嗯呐，开始调查的两个极端，要么毫无头绪要么一团乱麻”"}
{"time": 1768489156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287904606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“显然现在我们处在后者呢。。。啊，对了，楼梯有点脆弱呢，要不要去布莱克家找什么支撑一下”"}
{"time": 1768489170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080064193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”我赌它不会坏“"}
{"time": 1768489177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20653127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*开锁"}
{"time": 1768489224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679066625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "你们重回顶楼。有了钥匙，虽然有些生锈，但还是大体顺利的打开了锁"}
{"time": 1768489233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "722168723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "妮可再次戴上了手套和口罩"}
{"time": 1768489286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368349240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#查看楼顶"}
{"time": 1768489322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594669811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "等到其他人完全上楼以后，妮可走了上去，大吼呼吸起高层的空气"}
{"time": 1768489371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519148130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "*楼顶视野还算不错。空旷且还有一点残血"}
