{"time": 1768489404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047195789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "雪的痕迹。。。也没有太多值得在于的吗"}
{"time": 1768489428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606440398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "🈚️"}
{"time": 1768489461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966728693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "那么总之，待会去看看霍利（holy？？）路过的地方吧"}
{"time": 1768489484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693266798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“似乎什么都没有”"}
